          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരാതി — parāti — \"a complaint\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അച്ഛൻ പോലീസിൽ ഒരു പരാതി കൊടുത്തു. acchan pōlīsil oru parāti koṭuttu. Father filed a complaint with the police."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A complaint is given: പരാതി (parāti) കൊടുക്കുക. The verb is പരാതിപ്പെടുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of പരാതി (parāti) is not settled. It is the noun behind പരാതിപ്പെടുക, \"to complain\", and the usual word for a complaint to the police or an office."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
